The '''Loudmouth Bass''' is a {{Common}} item.

== Obtaining ==
A {{Item|Seal's Treat Bag}} has a {{Green|11.<span style{{=}}"text-decoration:overline;">1</span>%}} ({{Green|1}} in {{Green|9}}) chance to contain '''Loudmouth Bass'''.

A '''Loudmouth Bass''' can also be obtained as a Minor Reward during [[Raffle of the Century]] event, or from the {{Item|Gift Bag of the Century}}.

== Usage ==
A '''Loudmouth Bass''' can be used to challenge another player holding one to a duel. The winner's '''Loudmouth Bass''' will gain weight, while the losing party will lose their '''Loudmouth Bass'''.

The '''Loudmouth Bass''' upgrades its rarity depending on its weight:
