The losing party is rewarded with {{Item|Fish Food|amount=1}}, and {{Green|1}} {{Skill|Social|XP}} for every {{Green|10}} lb their '''Loudmouth Bass''' had, with a minimum of {{Green|100}} and a maximum of {{Green|500,000}} {{Skill|Social|XP}}.

The XP gained can be calculated using the following formula:

<math>
\text{SocialXPGained} = \max\left(100, \min\left(\left\lfloor\frac{\text{LoserBassWeight}}{10}\right\rfloor, 500\,000\right)\right)
</math>

For example: If the losing player's '''Loudmouth Bass''' weight is between {{Green|0}} and {{Green|1,000}} lb, then they will always get {{Green|100}} {{Skill|Social|XP}}. If the weight was {{Green|1,010}} lb, they will get 
{{Green|101}} {{Skill|Social|XP}}.

If losing player's '''Loudmouth Bass''' weight was more than {{Green|50}} lb, they will also get a {{Item|Skeleton the Fish}}.

