== Trivia ==
*A '''Loudmouth Bass''' cannot be recombobulated.
*The maximum possible weight a '''Loudmouth Bass''' can have is {{Green|4,000,000,000,000,000 lbs}}, or [[w:Names_of_large_numbers|4 quadrillion]]. After reaching this weight, its weight will not increase further.<!-- Confirmed via testing on AHN -->
**Despite it not increasing further beyond this point, chat feedback will say it does. This does not reflect in the item's description nor NBT data.<ref>[[File:Loudmouth Bass 4,000,000,000,000,000.png]]</ref>
* It would take {{Item|Seal's Treat Bag|amount=900009}}, worth {{AHPC|900009 Seal's Treat Bag}}, to reach {{Divine}} rarity.

